WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.410 --> 00:00:05.970
Hey guys, Pete here. Today I'm gonna do a
full recap of Dark season 2. Part of what

00:00:05.970 --> 00:00:09.540
I love about this show is its complexity,
but I tried to keep this video on the

00:00:09.540 --> 00:00:12.840
shorter side. That meant that I had to
leave out some of the smaller details

00:00:12.840 --> 00:00:16.440
which I love. So make sure to drop a
comment if you have questions about

00:00:16.440 --> 00:00:21.359
something that I didn't get into in this
recap. I plan on doing more dark videos

00:00:21.359 --> 00:00:25.199
while we wait for season 3 so hit the
subscribe button if you're a fan of the

00:00:25.199 --> 00:00:28.949
show. Obviously this is a recap of
everything that happened in Dark season

00:00:28.949 --> 00:00:32.730
2 and will be full of spoilers if you
haven't seen it yet.

00:00:32.730 --> 00:00:37.140
The first episode of Dark's second season
opens in a time period we haven't seen

00:00:37.140 --> 00:00:41.100
yet. There are two characters, who at
first glance, aren't anyone we've seen

00:00:41.100 --> 00:00:46.200
before. The time period is 1921 and the
characters who we see digging the

00:00:46.200 --> 00:00:51.239
passage in the caves are a younger Noah
and who I presume to be an older Bartosz.

00:00:51.239 --> 00:00:55.800
We never get confirmation that this is
Bartosz on screen but I would be shocked

00:00:55.800 --> 00:00:59.399
to learn that's not the case.
Noah kills the second man with the

00:00:59.399 --> 00:01:03.600
pickaxe after he accuses him of losing
his faith in their group Sic Mundus.

00:01:03.600 --> 00:01:07.740
Before he struck down he tells Noah that
he hopes that a day will come where he

00:01:07.740 --> 00:01:11.460
doesn't believe everything that Adam
tells him. He says that he should ask him

00:01:11.460 --> 00:01:16.380
why he took him in and why he chose to
call him Noah. Adam, whose face is covered

00:01:16.380 --> 00:01:20.790
with scar tissue, is the leader of
Sic Mundus, and the older Noah who we met

00:01:20.790 --> 00:01:24.869
in season 1 is also a member. We learned
that they're looking for missing pages

00:01:24.869 --> 00:01:30.060
from the triquetra notebook and Adam
says the apocalypse must come to pass.

00:01:30.060 --> 00:01:34.619
Younger Jonas wakes up from a dream of
having sex with Martha in the future.

00:01:34.619 --> 00:01:38.310
Remember he was sent there after
touching young Helge through the

00:01:38.310 --> 00:01:42.840
wormhole that opened in the bunker in
the season 1 finale. Season 2 takes place

00:01:42.840 --> 00:01:48.270
in June, episode 1 is on the 21st, so it's
just over six months removed from most

00:01:48.270 --> 00:01:52.200
of the events from season 1 which
happened in November. Jonas has been

00:01:52.200 --> 00:01:57.060
stuck in 2053 for a while and he wants
to travel back to stop the apocalypse on

00:01:57.060 --> 00:02:01.229
June 27th. We see him collecting
materials and listening to tapes that

00:02:01.229 --> 00:02:05.850
Claudia made at some time before he
arrived. Older Elisabeth Doppler is

00:02:05.850 --> 00:02:10.319
in an important role in the future, she
guards the area around the nuclear plant

00:02:10.319 --> 00:02:13.069
called the "dead zone",
and kills people who try to get inside.

00:02:13.069 --> 00:02:17.150
At this point we don't know why she's
doing that other than we hear them say

00:02:17.150 --> 00:02:21.799
Sick Mundus Creatus Est during a
hanging, but we do learn that Jonas is

00:02:21.799 --> 00:02:25.489
determined to enter the power plant and
when he does he finds a mysterious

00:02:25.489 --> 00:02:30.709
floating blob inside. In 2020 we meet a
new investigator named Clausen who we

00:02:30.709 --> 00:02:35.030
later learn volunteered for the position
of starting a task force with Charlotte.

00:02:35.030 --> 00:02:39.079
Six people have been missing for more
than six months in Winden and everyone

00:02:39.079 --> 00:02:43.879
is on edge. Stranger Jonas arrives at his
childhood home right in time to

00:02:43.879 --> 00:02:48.139
interrupt Hannah who's holding Boris
Niewald's gun to her throat. He reveals

00:02:48.139 --> 00:02:51.919
his identity to his mother and also
tells her about her husband Michael's

00:02:51.919 --> 00:02:56.030
true identity as Mikkel Nielsen. Some
other set up things that happen in the

00:02:56.030 --> 00:03:00.409
premiere - Alexander Tiedemann announces
that the power plant will be closing

00:03:00.409 --> 00:03:04.760
which means he has to hide the yellow
barrels. He decides to bury them under

00:03:04.760 --> 00:03:08.239
concrete inside the plant so that no one
will be able to find them.

00:03:08.239 --> 00:03:12.470
Bartosz and Martha break up and later
we see him meet Noah and go inside the

00:03:12.470 --> 00:03:18.169
caves. In 1921 we see older Noah talking
to his younger self who's having a hard

00:03:18.169 --> 00:03:22.609
time after killing the man at the caves.
Young Elizabeth finds a picture of Sic

00:03:22.609 --> 00:03:27.229
Mundus in a book at HG Tannhaus' shop
and identifies Noah to Peter.

00:03:27.229 --> 00:03:30.440
He tells Charlotte and we see that
they're working together putting

00:03:30.440 --> 00:03:35.329
together clues in the bunker. In the
second episode old Claudia visits her

00:03:35.329 --> 00:03:39.379
younger self to tell her about time
travel in Winden and later gives her a

00:03:39.379 --> 00:03:43.220
map telling her where to find the time
machine. She stresses that her younger

00:03:43.220 --> 00:03:47.540
self needs to stop Adam and plants the
seeds that things could turn out

00:03:47.540 --> 00:03:53.629
differently with Regina and her father
if she succeeds. Egon Tiedemann is now

00:03:53.629 --> 00:03:57.530
retired and has been diagnosed with
cancer. He begins thinking about things

00:03:57.530 --> 00:04:01.849
and interviews Helge Doppler who resides
in a mental facility. He can't provide

00:04:01.849 --> 00:04:06.049
any useful information about Mads'
disappearance the year before. Egon then

00:04:06.049 --> 00:04:10.430
decides to inquire about the man he
arrested 34 years ago for the murders of

00:04:10.430 --> 00:04:15.769
Eric and Yasin and the disappearance of
young Helge Doppler. It turns out Ulrich

00:04:15.769 --> 00:04:20.329
is still alive and has been confined to
a psychiatric unit this whole time. He

00:04:20.329 --> 00:04:24.409
doesn't tell Egon anything useful but
the interaction makes him suspect that

00:04:24.409 --> 00:04:27.879
he was wrong
about what happened back in 1953. In

00:04:27.879 --> 00:04:32.930
2020 Clausen and Charlotte visit Regina
Tiedemann for an interview

00:04:32.930 --> 00:04:37.520
Clausen seems to have an interest in
Regina's husband Alexander. Regina

00:04:37.520 --> 00:04:42.529
mentions that stranger Jonas stayed in
her hotel during the disappearances and

00:04:42.529 --> 00:04:46.189
she gives them a box filled with his
belongings that he left behind.

00:04:46.189 --> 00:04:49.699
Charlotte notices pages from her
grandfather's book and she makes an

00:04:49.699 --> 00:04:55.400
excuse to leave. Elsewhere stranger Jonas
brings Hannah back to 1987 to show her

00:04:55.400 --> 00:04:59.689
Mikkel living with a Ines. Hannah now
understands that her husband Michael was

00:04:59.689 --> 00:05:04.879
a time traveler and the son of the man
she was having an affair with. In 2053

00:05:04.879 --> 00:05:09.500
Jonas gets caught by Elizabeth trying to
re-enter the dead zone after gathering

00:05:09.500 --> 00:05:13.460
fuel he needed to make things work. He's
about to be hanged

00:05:13.460 --> 00:05:17.389
but Elisabeth saves him at the last
minute choosing to imprison him instead.

00:05:17.389 --> 00:05:22.189
Her translator Silja frees Jonas
because she wants to know why Elisabeth

00:05:22.189 --> 00:05:26.419
let him live and what she's hiding.
Jonas and Silja go back to the black

00:05:26.419 --> 00:05:29.810
blob inside the power plant which we
found out is known as the god particle

00:05:29.810 --> 00:05:35.539
from one of Claudia's tapes. The episode
ends as Jonas enters the stabilized god

00:05:35.539 --> 00:05:39.830
particle
leaving Silja and 2053 behind. In Episode

00:05:39.830 --> 00:05:44.180
three young Helge becomes the first
successful traveler through a new and

00:05:44.180 --> 00:05:49.099
improved chair. Noah sends him back to
1954 where he returns home to everyone's

00:05:49.099 --> 00:05:53.870
surprise. young Egon tries to learn what
happened from the boy but he won't speak

00:05:53.870 --> 00:05:57.080
to anyone until older Noah comes to
visit him later.

00:05:57.080 --> 00:06:02.000
Older claudia meets with Agnes Nielsen
in the bunker in 1954. We learned that

00:06:02.000 --> 00:06:05.930
Agnes and Noah are siblings and that
she's on the outs with Sic Mundus.

00:06:05.930 --> 00:06:10.520
Claudia gives her a newspaper clipping
which will see her take to Noah later in

00:06:10.520 --> 00:06:13.909
an effort to rejoin Sic Mundus. we
learned that it's a story about

00:06:13.909 --> 00:06:17.180
Claudia's death.
Claudia goes to visit her father at the

00:06:17.180 --> 00:06:22.039
police station and then visits HG Tannhaus
for one last time. She gets

00:06:22.039 --> 00:06:25.909
confronted by Noah who tells her she's
going to die. Before he shoots her

00:06:25.909 --> 00:06:30.319
Claudia makes a comment about him being
a pawn in a game he still doesn't know

00:06:30.319 --> 00:06:34.159
how to play. she says if you were free
you would have a choice and then he

00:06:34.159 --> 00:06:37.969
kills her anyway. When Noah recovers the
missing pages from the notebook he's

00:06:37.969 --> 00:06:40.429
visibly shook.
We hear him mention Charlotte's

00:06:40.429 --> 00:06:45.739
name saying, "no, this isn't right. this
isn't true." in 1987 a lot of stuff

00:06:45.739 --> 00:06:49.279
happens.
Ulrich tells Egon who he is and that

00:06:49.279 --> 00:06:53.089
he's from the future. when he goes back
to visit him later he brings a photo of

00:06:53.089 --> 00:06:57.679
Mikkel with him and that sets
Ulrich into a violent rage. Egon also

00:06:57.679 --> 00:07:01.909
tells his daughter about his cancer.
Middle Claudia visits Tannhaus for the

00:07:01.909 --> 00:07:06.889
first time with his book. He explains the
bootstrap paradox when something exists

00:07:06.889 --> 00:07:10.819
because it was sent back in time and
therefore has no point of creation. He

00:07:10.819 --> 00:07:14.209
tells her the book found me before I
even wrote it.

00:07:14.209 --> 00:07:19.159
She then travels for the first time to
2020 where she looks in on Regina and

00:07:19.159 --> 00:07:23.599
sees that she's sick.
In 1921 Adam asked Noah if he recovered

00:07:23.599 --> 00:07:29.059
the pages from the triquetra notebook. he
says that Claudia got what she deserved

00:07:29.059 --> 00:07:34.639
in the end we all get what we deserve. in
episode 4 we find out where Jonas went

00:07:34.639 --> 00:07:39.079
after he entered the god particle. he's
in 1921 where he meets a young or Noah

00:07:39.079 --> 00:07:43.909
who later takes him to meet Adam in his
lair under the church. Adam reveals that

00:07:43.909 --> 00:07:49.369
he is the oldest version of Jonas and I
for one believe that. in 2020 adult

00:07:49.369 --> 00:07:53.449
Claudia is at the library doing research
on what happened to her and her father.

00:07:53.449 --> 00:07:57.579
she learns that her father died and that
she disappeared. she then goes back to

00:07:57.579 --> 00:08:03.379
1987. in 2020 with three days to go until
the apocalypse things are starting to

00:08:03.379 --> 00:08:09.110
take shape. Martha, Franziska, Elisabeth and
Magnus start working together to figure

00:08:09.110 --> 00:08:13.759
out what's going on and eventually they
run into Bartosz in the caves. they end up

00:08:13.759 --> 00:08:17.509
taking the time machine from him not
knowing what it is and they leave him

00:08:17.509 --> 00:08:21.739
there overnight. Hannah and Stranger
Jonas talk to Charlotte and after

00:08:21.739 --> 00:08:25.669
sharing what they know decide to tell
Katharina about it. at first she thinks

00:08:25.669 --> 00:08:30.499
they're all crazy but later goes to the
school and finds Mikkel in the 1986

00:08:30.499 --> 00:08:35.269
class photo. Clausen also interviews
Aleksander learning that his last name

00:08:35.269 --> 00:08:39.800
was Koehler before he married Regina, but
we don't know why this is important yet.

00:08:39.800 --> 00:08:44.360
in the fifth episode Adam tells Jonas
that he can change the future and the

00:08:44.360 --> 00:08:49.459
past if he prevents his father from
killing himself. Adam shows Jonas his god

00:08:49.459 --> 00:08:54.889
particle time machine under the church
which can operate outside the 33 year cycle

00:08:54.889 --> 00:08:57.290
and take you to any day you want to
travel to.

00:08:57.290 --> 00:09:03.259
Jonas travels to the day before Michael
committed suicide in. 1987 Ulrich breaks

00:09:03.259 --> 00:09:06.740
out of the psychiatric ward and finds
Mikkel but they get caught by the police

00:09:06.740 --> 00:09:10.550
before they can enter the caves.
Claudia also learns about the yellow

00:09:10.550 --> 00:09:15.110
barrels from Bernd Doppler who asked her
to keep things a secret at least until

00:09:15.110 --> 00:09:21.230
he dies. in 2020 Charlotte reveals to
stranger Jonas that Tannhaus is not

00:09:21.230 --> 00:09:25.850
her real grandfather and that she never
knew her parents. later Noah finds

00:09:25.850 --> 00:09:29.899
Charlotte and reveals that he is her
father but won't reveal who her mother

00:09:29.899 --> 00:09:34.639
is. the teens make Bartosz show them how
the time machine works and they take a

00:09:34.639 --> 00:09:39.889
brief trip to the 1980s. when they return
Martha finds the St. Christopher pendant

00:09:39.889 --> 00:09:46.069
that stranger Jonas left on her pillow.
episode 6 is the odd episode in this

00:09:46.069 --> 00:09:51.620
season that doesn't occur in the lead-up
to the apocalypse. instead we are in 2019

00:09:51.620 --> 00:09:56.779
the day before Michael kills himself.
young Jonas arrives from 1921 which

00:09:56.779 --> 00:10:01.040
means we have two versions of the
younger Jonas walking around at the lake.

00:10:01.040 --> 00:10:04.550
the original one finds the st.
Christopher pendant while he's sitting

00:10:04.550 --> 00:10:09.199
with Martha. they talk and almost kiss but
he leaves abruptly telling her that he

00:10:09.199 --> 00:10:13.100
has to go teach his grandma how to use
her new tablet. traveling young Jonas

00:10:13.100 --> 00:10:17.329
then pulls a switcheroo because in his
mind he's going to talk his father out

00:10:17.329 --> 00:10:20.990
of committing suicide which will mean
he'll never exist.

00:10:20.990 --> 00:10:25.279
he tells Martha you and I are perfect for
each other never believe anything else.

00:10:25.279 --> 00:10:30.139
they share a kiss which will lead to his
slightly younger self getting laid later

00:10:30.139 --> 00:10:34.130
that evening. the Nielsen's are throwing
a party to celebrate Katharina and

00:10:34.130 --> 00:10:38.660
Ulrich's wedding anniversary. young Jonas
and Hannah go to the party while the

00:10:38.660 --> 00:10:41.029
traveling young Jonas talks to his
father.

00:10:41.029 --> 00:10:45.110
we learn that Michael hasn't been
suicidal and he reveals that it was

00:10:45.110 --> 00:10:50.689
Jonas who led him into the caves and
took him to 1986. older Claudia arrives

00:10:50.689 --> 00:10:54.829
and tells the Jonas that Michael must
kill himself so everything happens the

00:10:54.829 --> 00:10:59.750
same way it always has. Jonas is
persuaded and after a tearful goodbye he

00:10:59.750 --> 00:11:04.819
leaves Michael to write his suicide
letter. in episode 7 older Claudia's dead

00:11:04.819 --> 00:11:08.240
body
is discovered in the woods in 1954. Egon

00:11:08.240 --> 00:11:12.110
thinks that she may have played a part
in Helge's kidnapping.

00:11:12.110 --> 00:11:16.520
he asked the boy about her but he only
responds by calling Claudia the white

00:11:16.520 --> 00:11:21.530
devil. after stealing the time machine
from stranger Jonas Hannah arrives in

00:11:21.530 --> 00:11:26.090
this time period to visit Ulrich after
talking to him she decides to leave him

00:11:26.090 --> 00:11:29.750
where he is.
later in Egons office she says that

00:11:29.750 --> 00:11:34.430
she's looking for a fresh start
indicating that she might stay in 1954

00:11:34.430 --> 00:11:38.090
for a while.
in 1987 it's the day of her father's

00:11:38.090 --> 00:11:42.200
death and Claudia is trying to prevent
it. he tells her that he knows about time

00:11:42.200 --> 00:11:46.280
travel and she tries to play dumb at
first. things escalate to where he

00:11:46.280 --> 00:11:50.870
figures out that she knows and she gets
angry. he tries to call the police to

00:11:50.870 --> 00:11:54.230
tell them what he knows and they get
into a fight where she tries to take the

00:11:54.230 --> 00:11:58.730
phone from him. he falls busting his head
open on a table and she decides to let

00:11:58.730 --> 00:12:02.690
him bleed out thinking that this has to
happen so that he will later be saved.

00:12:02.690 --> 00:12:07.070
before he dies he says you are the white
devil when she returns to her home

00:12:07.070 --> 00:12:11.720
younger traveling Jonas arrives and
tells her that they have to leave. he

00:12:11.720 --> 00:12:15.800
says he knows what she did but says it
doesn't have to happen that way again.

00:12:15.800 --> 00:12:18.890
when she asked where they're going he
says the future.

00:12:18.890 --> 00:12:23.330
Clausen confronts Aleksander at the power
plant revealing that he had a brother

00:12:23.330 --> 00:12:28.940
named Aleksander Koehler who went missing
in 1986, and that he is not him. in the

00:12:28.940 --> 00:12:32.300
season 2 finale
Jonas explains to Claudia everything

00:12:32.300 --> 00:12:36.740
that her older self knew about time
travel and the coming apocalypse. Jonas

00:12:36.740 --> 00:12:41.090
suggests that they probably can't change
the big things using time travel but

00:12:41.090 --> 00:12:45.710
perhaps they can change the details. he
says we can change a grain of sand, and

00:12:45.710 --> 00:12:50.120
with that the whole world.
Charlotte learns that Alexander buried

00:12:50.120 --> 00:12:54.110
the radioactive waste and she's worried
that Clausen investigation will lead

00:12:54.110 --> 00:12:58.340
him to it. she heads over to the power
plant to try to stop him. we learned that

00:12:58.340 --> 00:13:00.830
after finding out that Charlotte was his
daughter

00:13:00.830 --> 00:13:05.720
Noah decided that he had to kill Adam
and he sets out to do that. Adam isn't

00:13:05.720 --> 00:13:10.190
fazed by this saying it's not his
destiny to die yet. Noah tries but is

00:13:10.190 --> 00:13:14.360
unable to shoot him and in the process
it's revealed that Noah's wife is an

00:13:14.360 --> 00:13:17.080
older Elisabeth
meaning Elisabeth is both

00:13:17.080 --> 00:13:21.850
Charlotte's daughter and her mother. as
Adam is telling him that, "this knot can

00:13:21.850 --> 00:13:26.860
only be undone by destroying it
completely," Agnes and older Magnus and

00:13:26.860 --> 00:13:30.850
who we presume is the older Franziska
enter the room.

00:13:30.850 --> 00:13:35.890
Agnes takes the gun from Noah and she's
able to use it to kill him. adult Jonas

00:13:35.890 --> 00:13:40.360
finds Martha and forces her to go into
the bunker at gunpoint. he says he can't

00:13:40.360 --> 00:13:44.350
watch her die again and begs her to stay
there. you might be thinking that this

00:13:44.350 --> 00:13:48.910
doesn't make sense because his younger
self saw her die and for me this is one

00:13:48.910 --> 00:13:52.870
of those things that make Dark great. even
though he knows it probably won't work

00:13:52.870 --> 00:13:57.610
he still feels compelled to try, which is
what I imagine all of us would do in

00:13:57.610 --> 00:14:01.810
that situation even knowing full well
that we were at the mercy of a

00:14:01.810 --> 00:14:06.310
deterministic universe. at the nuclear
plant Clausen gains access and pretty

00:14:06.310 --> 00:14:10.690
much goes straight to where the yellow
barrels are buried. young Jonas and

00:14:10.690 --> 00:14:15.100
Claudia go through the caves and
activate the time machine opening the

00:14:15.100 --> 00:14:19.240
portal back up. he explains that he's
accepted that he needs to play a part in

00:14:19.240 --> 00:14:23.590
the disaster that he wants to prevent.
Peter takes Elisabeth to the bunker to

00:14:23.590 --> 00:14:28.120
keep her safe, and when they open the
door Martha runs out to find Jonas

00:14:28.120 --> 00:14:33.790
Claudia finds Regina and also brings her
to the bunker. young Jonas and Martha are

00:14:33.790 --> 00:14:39.160
reunited at his home where Adam shows up.
Adam travelled to 2020 through the god

00:14:39.160 --> 00:14:43.900
particle and he's there to kill Martha.
he shoots her and explains that in order

00:14:43.900 --> 00:14:47.860
for him to exist
Jonas had to see her die and feel that

00:14:47.860 --> 00:14:54.160
pain. in 2053 we see Elisabeth go inside
the dead zone and activate the god

00:14:54.160 --> 00:14:59.440
particle at the same time that Claussen
is having one of his police force use a

00:14:59.440 --> 00:15:03.820
jackhammer to break into the concrete
that was poured over the yellow barrels.

00:15:03.820 --> 00:15:08.380
Charlotte gets there and tries to stop
him but he won't listen to her. he

00:15:08.380 --> 00:15:13.320
insists on opening it. at that same time
elisabeth activates the god particle in

00:15:13.320 --> 00:15:20.530
2053. older Magnus and his partner
activate theirs in 1921 and we watch as

00:15:20.530 --> 00:15:25.120
the contents inside the yellow barrel
that Claussen opened becomes the god

00:15:25.120 --> 00:15:30.700
particle. we watch as a portal opens
we're Elisabeth in 2053 can see

00:15:30.700 --> 00:15:35.590
Charlotte in 2020 they go to touch each
other and that's when the apocalypse

00:15:35.590 --> 00:15:40.120
hits Winden. we know that several of the
characters died because we saw their

00:15:40.120 --> 00:15:46.900
graves in 2053 when Jonas was there. he's
still in his home at Martha's side and

00:15:46.900 --> 00:15:52.120
before the explosion can reach it he's
saved by a version of Martha who tells

